tD9fcKwnAg&oe=69F0B02B"}, {"file_name": "vlcsnap-2024-07-26-18h03m49s591.png", "id": "454320890749453", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974790_454320894082786_707571771440452654_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=i2dBhQwubVAQ7kNvwGs-Pii&_nc_oc=Adp0fX63rS2Le1zX3zEo4zrb-uDzpfRP667tMmq74tMlVogMrULdHBSVH9FGGOUNQJY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_Af33RoealnDaZrVS-x45NcKAiC4xt8lIJRNlVTJ32DgnZw&oe=69F0C1B0"}, {"file_name": "vlcsnap-2024-07-26-18h06m56s734.png", "id": "1015866550329656", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39031656_1015866556996322_7240666593516287157_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=SnrzJpb_MRoQ7kNvwFnRavP&_nc_oc=AdpuPCs4kmxOdpAd9XDc_W_QRdpBnORTxOVrnuxuTqJ3hMOZpT1Uv-rXmAAETY4Wvgo&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_Af36O0ugX4fVHStcHNkGgYhddBOhgxwuTwwQuWR4YtFU-A&oe=69F0B81D"}, {"file_name": "vlcsnap-2025-12-18-14h52m05s723.png", "id": "4185474071770816", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491819417_4185474075104149_4003894709593372408_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=ILswX183AboQ7kNvwFu5H7s&_nc_oc=AdoVJ1ZyNo2CN74uNu3dDLcXSm6bRUV9dfk-_ToeeP9DIbpT9NI5vudN7hVpU66VqNw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_Af0FD-R5I_dVmAvNCZJ5QBnCvPVZIIuKS2Xtp-mBDF53rQ&oe=69F09F50"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Master comp (cover_art_landscape_2560x1440)_BEHIND_vB-02 with logo.png", "id": "1320764112426735", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39031450_1320764115760068_1122392115874745582_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=g6T2TqxqCL4Q7kNvwH3-xh8&_nc_oc=Ado5KT7ch5xr8mVy3nUKNTcaVSDG9z0t4GkXheUmqQWUUf9dv-7nHhI0VQyRm-gp3kY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_Af1WLYynt939w9tpmEepaiarBwRe1Dgs37pzRVd5AQ1yxQ&oe=69F0D216"}, "display_name": "DodgeALL", "keywords": ["Action", "Dodge", "Physical", "Social", "Fitness"], "long_description": "**DodgeALL** is a high-intensity VR game that puts your agility and reflexes to the test. Engage in a world where the only rule is to dodge everything that comes your way! With immersive 3D environments and physics-based gameplay, each level presents a new challenge, offering endless replayability. Dodge, duck, dip, dive and crawl around in this adrenaline-fueled game, where your skill, speed and stamina determine your survival.\n\n# Are you ready to DodgeALL?\n\n# Features include:\n- Mixed Reality Mode: Now available via a new campaign or in Party Mode.\n- Party Mode: Play against friends & family using Android/iOS smartphones and tablets. Choose to be naughty or nice (or both). To join in, simply download the companion app \"DodgeALL Party\" for free from the app store.\n- Room-scale & 360 degrees: Where you can move in your room is where you can move in the game. No fake movement: **No VR nausea here!**\n- 3D Spatial Audio: Gives audible cues where obstacles are coming from.\n- Abilities: 5 unlockable abilities to help when things get hot.\n- Endless Mode: Play any unlocked level until you drop. Each iteration gets progressively faster.\n- Leaderboards: Compare your dodging skills to other players.\n- Twitch interactive mode: Let your viewers throw things at you!\n- Bonus levels: New crazy challenges released regularly.\n- Custom levels: Create your own levels (SideQuest required).\n\nJoin the Discord for questions, bugs, feedback or to give me ideas for new bonus levels: \nhttps://dodgeall.com/discord", "short_description": "DODGE ALL THE THINGS!!1 \n\nDodge, duck, dip, dive and crawl your way through a nonstop onslaught of obstacles coming at you everywhere you look.\n\nNow supports Mixed Reality!\n- New Mixed Reality SciFi Campaign\n- Party Mode in Mixed Reality\n\nNow supports Local Multiplayer!\n- Party Mode allows your friends with iOS/Android smartphones and tablets to interact with you using a free and easy to use app."}]}, "developer_name":